8872.mp4?t=1773940566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take care of your chickens, cows, and sheep to produce fresh goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfa Stock the Shelves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After harvesting, organize your products and place them on market shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what to sell and how to display it \u2014 keep your shop clean, full, and attractive to draw in customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.poster.avif?t=1773940566\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.webm?t=1773940566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.mp4?t=1773940566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restock your shelves with fresh produce and handmade goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Serve Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your market gets busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers wait in line, ready to buy. Scan their items, pack their bags, and make sure they leave happy. A fast checkout makes them love your store even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/df9f8a3ed14e96dbd4658138eccc76d2.poster.avif?t=1773940566\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a